#
#   scripts/clion/tools.local.env.example -- per-machine tool settings for CLion.
#
#   Copy to scripts/clion/tools.local.env (not committed) and uncomment what you need.
#   The wrappers in scripts/clion source it, so it suits settings you do not want in your
#   login shell.  Anything assigned here overrides the environment.
#

# Meadow OpenOCD build (as used by flash.sh, debug.sh and deploy.sh).
# MEADOW_OPENOCD_DIR="$HOME/GitHub/ThirdParty/openocd"

# GDB to use instead of arm-none-eabi-gdb (macOS) or gdb-multiarch (Linux) on PATH.
# MEADOW_GDB=/path/to/arm-none-eabi-gdb
